    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are thrilled to present to the market 82 Seapark Drive, a warm and welcoming 3 bed mid-terrace house in this highly sought after location. The property has a wonderful sense of space as one walks through the house, has been lovingly maintained over the years. This fine property is within walking distance of all the amenities Clontarf has to offer and only 1 minute walk from Clontarf Promenade. \r\n\r\nThis light filled accommodation extends to approx. 99 sq m / 1,065 sq ft and comprises in brief of an entrance hall, living room, dining room, kitchen / breakfast room, sunroom and WC all downstairs. While upstairs there are 2 spacious double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a bathroom. There is a private low maintenance west facing rear garden, with a garage with vehicular laneway access and a driveway with off-street parking to the front. \r\n\r\nThe location of Seapark Drive is second to none. Clontarf promenade and cycle track, and Clontarf village and its various boutiques and restaurants are within walking distance. Eastpoint Business Park, the IFSC and Clontarf DART station are just a short distance away.  There is a superb choice of both primary and secondary schools in the vicinity. The area is serviced by excellent transport links to the City Centre and beyond, with a quality bus corridor on the Clontarf Road. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also within a short drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\r\nSpacious and welcoming entrance hall with storage press and alarm panel\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\r\nBright room overlooking the front of the property with laminate and gas fireplace with tiled surround\r\n\r\nDining Room:\r\nBright room overlooking the sun room with carpet flooring and open fireplace with tiled surround\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining / Family Room:\r\nBright, extended kitchen to the rear of the property with wall and floor units, lino flooring and ample dining space. Singe door to:\r\n\r\nSun Room:\r\nLean-to sun room to the rear of the house, plumbed for washing machine. With laminate flooring and access to:\r\n\r\nWC:\r\nWith WC and wash hand basin\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the front with carpet flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nSingle bedroom overlooking the front with carpet flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin with storage and walk-in electric shower\r\n\r\nAttic:\r\nStorage attic with Stira\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nTo the front is a driveway with off-street parking and to the rear is a west facing rear garden laid in patio with a block-built storage shed and a garage with vehicular laneway access.\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nOff-street parking\r\nResidents gated laneway\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: D\r\nBER No.: 119860583\r\n\r\nContents - Included: carpets, blinds, light fittings, integrated and non-integrated appliances and all standard fixtures and fittings"
      },
